---
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>a11lied</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --page-bg: #f7f4ea;
        --ink: #1f1f1b;
        --accent: #17606d;
        --muted: #6c675f;
        --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: "IBM Plex Sans", "Avenir Next", sans-serif;
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(23, 96, 109, 0.12), transparent 32rem),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #fbfaf5 0%, var(--page-bg) 100%);
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      main {
        width: min(72rem, calc(100% - 3rem));
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 7vw, 5rem);
        line-height: 0.95;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }

      p {
        max-width: 44rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 1.25rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(31, 31, 27, 0.08);
        border-radius: 1.25rem;
        background: var(--card);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      }

      .card strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
      }

      .muted {
        color: var(--muted);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="eyebrow">a11lied</div>
      <h1>Screen reader automation that starts in the CLI.</h1>
      <p>
        This docs app is a first-pass landing page while the product surface is still being shaped.
        The real detail lives in the repo: research notes under <code>research/</code>, the plan under
        <code>plans/</code>, and the initial workspaces under <code>packages/</code>.
      </p>

      <div class="grid">
        <section class="card">
          <strong>CLI first</strong>
          <span class="muted">Design the command surface before the rest of the product hardens around it.</span>
        </section>
        <section class="card">
          <strong>Guidepup backed</strong>
          <span class="muted">Use real VoiceOver and NVDA where it matters, virtual automation where speed matters.</span>
        </section>
        <section class="card">
          <strong>Modular by default</strong>
          <span class="muted">Keep the runtime, MCP server, Storybook bridge, docs, and skill publish path decoupled.</span>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
